{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12108100","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12108100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1210810001:0":{"text":"お姉ちゃん、こ、この人たちは誰なの……？","source_cn":"索尼娅姐姐，这、这些是什么人啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97C5269637074655","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210810002:0":{"text":"……お姉ちゃんの、友だちだ。","source_cn":"……是我的朋友们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11171FAB0F3E4605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210810003:0":{"text":"友だち……？お姉ちゃんの友だちは、ワタシだけのはずじゃ……？","source_cn":"朋友……姐姐的朋友，不是只有我一个吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x480D769A3361B848","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1210810003":{"text":"友だち……？お姉ちゃんの友だちは、ワタシだけのはずじゃ……？","source_cn":"朋友……姐姐的朋友，不是只有我一个吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x480D769A3361B848","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210810004:1":{"text":"記憶がないらしい……あたしと一緒に暮らしていた子ども時代のナーラに戻っているんだ。","source_cn":"奈拉失忆了……她好像回到了当年和我相依为命的童年。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9479A5B69E6B9DF3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"記憶がないらしい……あたしと一緒に暮らしていた子ども時代のナーラに戻っているんだ。","female":"記憶がないらしい……あたしと一緒に暮らしていた子ども時代のナーラに戻っているんだ。","variant_male_record_index":"131947","variant_female_record_index":"131948","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210810006:0":{"text":"まさか本気にしてないよな？ラスティーアンカーじゃ、こういうのは悪党の常套句だぜ、ソニアさん。","source_cn":"索尼娅，你不会真上当了吧？这种戏码，锈锚港的混混都演腻了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9036D60F3E36E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210810007:0":{"text":"さっきまで悪事を働いてた奴が、気を失って目が覚めたら善人になりました？どう考えてもありえねぇだろ。","source_cn":"前一秒还满肚子坏水，被打一棍子昏过去，醒过来就变成好人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1426E0C0EEFCABB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210810008:1":{"text":"正直、あたしも驚いている。","source_cn":"坦白说，我的惊讶不比你们少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70837BCBD99891FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210810009:1":{"text":"だから確認してみたんだ。ナーラは間違いなく多くのことを忘れている。","source_cn":"但我已经确认过了，奈拉的确忘记了很多事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB76C5D79C77BB2C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210810010:1":{"text":"この子の記憶は……<style=\"highlight\">あたしたちが海難事故に遭う前</style>まで巻き戻ってしまっている。","source_cn":"她的记忆回到了小时候……回到了<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E33591369F9E232","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210810011:1":{"text":"それが演技だという可能性は？ひょっとしたら俺たちが油断するのを狙って……","source_cn":"万一她是装的，等我们松懈了给我们一刀，后果不堪设想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C01C1EBC5AD92E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210810012:1":{"text":"今までのナーラを見てきただろ。この子に役者の素質があると思うか？","source_cn":"你觉得，以她的逻辑和智商，她有演员的素养？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88074253417F6044","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210810013:1":{"text":"ははっ、確かにいい役者にはなれそうもないな。","source_cn":"哈！这个笑话一点也不好笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBDDC4DACCDACF48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210810014:1":{"text":"あんたにとって……むしろこのままであってほしいと思ってるんだろ？","source_cn":"其实……是你心里更希望她失忆了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BD229545012D9A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210810015:1":{"text":"……そうかもしれない。","source_cn":"也许是吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD26C24D889511A92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210810016:1":{"text":"俺たちの宝探しを邪魔しないよう、妹さんをしっかり見張っておけよ。","source_cn":"那就把她看好，别影响了我们寻宝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BA782D9B4D78B6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210810017:0":{"text":"宝探し！？お宝があるの？ナーラ、お宝大好き！","source_cn":"寻宝？！有宝贝吗？！奈拉喜欢宝贝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB39EC851DDE49DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210810018:0":{"text":"おいおい、急に近づいてくんな、危ねぇだろーが！","source_cn":"喂喂喂，说话就说话，别突然凑过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57C181BB8AC57ADD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210810019:1":{"text":"なんで？お姉ちゃんの友だちなんでしょ？友だちはぶたないし、パンをとったりしないもん。","source_cn":"为什么不可以？你们是姐姐的朋友，不会打我，也不会抢我的面包。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC732ADC311413635","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210810020:1":{"text":"えへへ、アナタたちはいい人！ナーラ、いい人大好き！","source_cn":"嘻嘻，你们是好人！我喜欢好人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5463A6BDAEC3EA58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1210810021:0":{"text":"ったく……記憶喪失になる前より面倒くさくなってねぇか？","source_cn":"啧……失忆了比之前还难缠。","status":"matched","